      "message": "test(app): the stock-source pocket in lead_approach stays off the part\n\nCommit 086f4010 (#1603) made the helper `beside_the_cut_part` assert that\nthe stock-source pocket on Milling-test.step cuts the part. PR #1656\n(#1554) then made a stock-source pocket clear the stock around the part,\nso the pocket no longer cuts it and two tests failed on main. The helper\nnow asserts that the pocket has no Gouge, and the entry-law checks read\nthe remaining warnings as before.\n\nFixes #1675\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
